"B<formail> [B<\\+>I<skip>] [B<->I<total>] [B<-bczfrktedqBY>] [B<-p> "
"I<prefix>]"
msgstr ""
"B<formail> [B<\\+>I<omite>] [B<->I<total>] [B<-bczfrktedqBY>] [B<-p> "
"I<prefix>]"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide mageia-cauldron
